"{{Term/Store|The Secret Club's Secret||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|The Secret Club's Secret}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Gerudo Town}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
Through the doorway behind [[Fashion Passion]], the [[Armor Shop]] in [[Gerudo Town]], is a curtain that conceals an entrance to the [[Gerudo Secret Club]]. If [[Link]] attempts to enter, [[Saula]] stops him, telling him that the doorway is not for customers.<ref>{{Cite|Ah, um, that doorway isn't for customers, actually...|Saula|BotW}}</ref> She then whispers to use the door on the side of the building if he is a member.<ref>{{Cite|{{Small|If you're a member, please head around to the door on the side.}}|Saula|BotW}}</ref> There, Link will find a closed, wooden door. If he attempts to open it, he will hear [[Greta]] from the other side of the door asking for the password.<ref>{{Cite|...What's the password?|Greta|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to enter the Gerudo Secret Club before beginning the Side Quest by either guessing the password or learning it beforehand. The Quest will begin when Link enters the shop.}}

The password contains three letters and a symbol, which Link must give to Greta one at a time at her prompting.<ref>{{Cite|And what comes next?|Greta|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|And after that?|Greta|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|And what comes last?|Greta|BotW}}</ref> Link is only able to guess the password once per day.<ref>{{Cite|If you get our password wrong, you have to wait until the next day to try again.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> If Link gets it wrong, Greta will tell him to go drink milk at [[The Noble Canteen]].<ref>{{Cite|Go drink milk in the bar or something!|Greta|BotW}}</ref> This begins the [[Side Quest]].

At The Noble Canteen, Link will encounter three [[Gerudo]] women drinking: [[Pyra]], [[Sumati]], and [[Yaido]]. Yaido mentions that she recently learned the password for a secret location.<ref>{{Cite|Oh, I was going to tell you... I finally got my hands on the {{Color BotW|Blue|password}} for you-know-where.|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> Though Sumati calls the place crazy,<ref>{{Cite|Seriously? Wow... That place is a little crazy, isn't it?|Sumati|BotW}}</ref> Pyra is interested in it.<ref>{{Cite|Maybe, but I'm really interested...|Pyra|BotW}}</ref> Yaido begins to share the password,<ref>{{Cite|Anyway, the password is...|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> but Sumati notices Link listening to their conversation.<ref>{{Cite|Wait a second! You!! Did  you really think we wouldn't see you standing there, listening to our conversation?!|Sumati|BotW}}</ref> She calls him rude and tells him to leave.<ref>{{Cite|So rude! This is a private conversation! Go away!|Sumati|BotW}}</ref>

Next door to The Noble Canteen is the home of [[Rotana]] and [[Pearle]]. Every night, Pearle hears the voices from the patrons of The Noble Canteen through her window,<ref>{{Cite|*sigh* Night after night, the voices of the people in the cant-eenter come right in my window. They're super loud...|Pearle|BotW}}</ref> and if someone were to stand under it, they would hear everything said inside.<ref>{{Cite|If you stand under the window, you can hear everything they're saying...|Pearle|BotW}}</ref> Link can stand under the window to eavedrop on the women's conversation.{{Note|If Link eavesdrops on the women here before ever speaking to them in The Noble Canteen, he will hear Yaido asking the others if they have heard the rumor about Fashion Passion.<ref>{{Cite|Hey, have you heard the {{Color BotW|Red|rumor about Fashion Passion}}?|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> Sumati replies that she has heard the rumor,<ref>{{Cite|I have!|Sumati|BotW}}</ref> and Yaido responds by saying that she had asked Saula about it, but she would not tell her anything.<ref>{{Cite|I tried asking Saula about it indirectly, but she wouldn't tell me anything.|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> Pyra then mentions how suspicious Saula is.<ref>{{Cite|Doesn't Saula work at Fashion Passion? Geez, that's extremely suspicious...|Pyra|BotW}}</ref>}} Sumati complains about the [[Hylian]] woman who spoke to them,<ref>{{Cite|What was up with that little Hylian vai earlier, anyway?|Sumati|BotW}}</ref> but Pyra dismisses it and urges Yaido to share the password.<ref>{{Cite|Forget her! Just hurry up and tell us the password, Yaido!|Pyra|BotW}}</ref> Yaido reveals she overheard Saula using the password, "GSC♦".<ref>{{Cite|Oh, that's right, the password! It's {{Color BotW|Red|GSC♦}}. I overheard Saula talking about it, so I'm sure that's right!|Yaido|BotW}}</ref> Sumati remarks that the "GSC" must stand for Gerudo Secret Club, but she wonders what the diamond stands for.<ref>{{Cite|{{Color BotW|Red|GSC♦}}? What could that... Oh, I get it. Gerudo Secret Club—GSC. But what's the {{Color BotW|Red|♦}} at the end mean?|Sumati|BotW}}</ref>

Once Link has the password, he can return to the wooden door to share it with Greta. After Link gets it right, Greta will allow him into the Gerudo Secret Club.<ref>{{Cite|All right... You can come in.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> Once Link is inside, she realizes that she has never seen him around before.<ref>{{Cite|Hey... I haven't seen your face around here before...|Greta|BotW}}</ref> She calls Link a rare visitor,<ref>{{Cite|Hmm... Heh heh heh... Looks like we've got ourselves a rare visitor.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> promising not to ask any questions if he does not.<ref>{{Cite|I guess I have a suspicious mind... So maybe you don't ask too many questions, and I won't either.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> Greta then accepts Link as a member of the Gerudo Secret Club,<ref>{{Cite|You're a member here now, so thanks for your patronage.|Greta|BotW}}</ref> which completes the Side Quest.

